title: "PBLang: Sovereign Systems, Scientific, Quantum & Multi-Target Programming Language"
message: "If you use PBLang, its Sovereign Runtime, Compiler, Standard Library, or Quantum/Math Engines in software, research, or publications, please cite it using this metadata."
