abstract: >-
  PBLang 5.4.0 is a 100% sovereign Pure-PBLang (.sapp) multi-target systems,
  scientific, visual RAD, AI/GPU, and quantum-ready programming language featuring
  a minimal Zero-Rust native host bootstrap, pure-PBLang 64-bit VAL_I64 + 64 KiB
  OS-page slab/@region GC + CSPRNG SipHash-1-3 microkernel, Stage-4 SSA/SIMD/RISC-V
  self-hosted compiler, Zero-OpenSSL TLS 1.3 + Hybrid PQC X25519MLKEM768 + QUIC,
  live physical Vulkan/OpenCL @gpu SPIR-V compute, Sovereign ACID B+Tree/WAL/MVCC
  PBDB, live industrial Modbus/SocketCAN/TPM 2.0/PKCS#11 hardware drivers, and
  universal executable emission across 64-bit, 32-bit, 16-bit, 8-bit, MCU, mobile,
  and WebAssembly/WASI targets.
keywords:
  - programming-language
  - compiler
  - virtual-machine
  - sovereign-runtime
  - gpu-spirv
  - post-quantum-cryptography
  - webassembly
  - quantum-computing
  - scientific-computing
  - provenance
